Scope: this license covers the blog post "A GNSS-disciplined NTP, NTS and PTP
time server on a Raspberry Pi 5 with Ubuntu 26.04 LTS" and its companion files
(time_burner.py, time-burner.service, gps-baud-change.sh, gps-baud.service,
pps-optimize.sh).

It does not cover material from the referenced articles by Austin's Nerdy
Things (https://austinsnerdythings.com), which remain (c) Austin's Nerdy
Things. Parts of the PTP grandmaster configuration (ptp-gm.conf layout and the
ptp4l-grandmaster / phc2sys-grandmaster / ptp_nic_coalesce unit structure) are
adapted from Austin's PTP tutorial and are credited in the post.
